      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey my legs have been cramping really bad lately and im just feeling super wiped out all the time... i think my electrolytes might be off. i have stage 3 kidney disease so i gotta be careful but do u think taking a potassium supplement would help with the cramps? i saw some 99mg ones at the store",
